rule dearest_line v1
description "Whether an order holds a dear line. An order comes to 150 yen or more, and a line is 100 yen at most: the dearest line reaches the bottom only with other lines beside it, none of them dearer"

# A line of the order
elements lines
  price : money[JPY]  range >=1JPY <=100JPY

max dearest over lines of price empty 0JPY
sum total over lines of price  range >=150JPY <=500JPY

outputs
  pricey : bool

table pricey_of
policy unique
| dearest | -> pricey |
| <50JPY  | false     |
| >=50JPY | true      |
